  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "キャンプの　りょうりに　つかう\nしょくざいの　いっしゅ。ポテトが\nからさを　うちけし　マイルドにする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "캠프 요리에 사용되는\n식재료 중 하나. 감자가 매운맛을\n잡아주고 부드럽게 만들어준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作露營料理時使用的食材之一。\n洋芋能夠中和辣味，\n使料理的味道變得溫和。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient de cuisine pour le camping.\nCes féculents permettent d’atténuer le piquant\ndu curry pour le rendre plus doux.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Zutat für PokéCamping-Mahlzeiten. Kartoffeln\nnehmen würzigen Speisen etwas von ihrer Schärfe und\nmachen sie milder.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente para cocinar en el campamento. Las\npatatas contrarrestan el picante y suavizan el plato.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Uno degli ingredienti che puoi usare per cucinare\nin campeggio. Smorzano i gusti piccanti donando\nal piatto un sapore più delicato.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the many ingredients that can be used for\ncooking at your camp. Potatoes help mellow out a spicy\ntaste, to make a dish more mild.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "キャンプの　料理に　使う\n食材の　一種。ポテトが\n辛さを　打ち消し　マイルドにする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在露营营地制作料理时会使用的\n一种食材。土豆能中和辣味，\n使整道料理的滋味变得柔和。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente para cocinar en el campamento. Las\npatatas contrarrestan el picante y suavizan el plato.",
